es":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Dl_okrFTBWMHm7zaIn-cqA","review_id":"2AP9hGjAQd5Uh_ycJSQEgw","date":"2018-01-25T01:44:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9261085391044617,"text_excerpt":"Nice clean location. The service was very nice & informative. The food arrived fast and was hot too. I had the crawfish queso with I'll pass on next time there were very little crawfish In the queso. I also had the shrimp tacos w garlic fries that was great and the fries didn't disappoint. Last I had the free ice cream which is always a winner in my book. I would visit this location again."},{"business_id":"Dl_okrFTBWMHm7zaIn-cqA","review_id":"eG4YVwDNXMkKbKY0PWIpDw","date":"2017-03-04T14:29:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9211167693138123,"text_excerpt":"If you want a good, quick lunch in The East, NHS is the place to go. New Orleans East is one of the most interesting areas in the city. I often find myself there and have noticed that despite the large population, good dining options are somewhat scarce. I usually stick with Duong Phong or Vucinivich, but on a recent Sunday I needed a quick meal with a coworker who was not as adventurous as I am. We found ourselves across the street from this location so it was if fate made the decision for us. There was a slight line at the ordering counter when we arrived. Sunday seems to be pretty busy but I was able to order and seat myself quickly. I wanted something very simple so I ordered their on..."},{"business_id":"Dl_okrFTBWMHm7zaIn-cqA","review_id":"G70bytJrTMxN6g5K7wK9ZQ","date":"2016-03-12T01:49:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9206168055534363,"text_excerpt":"Finally New Orleans East has a nice casual dining restaurant. I hope this is the sign of more to come. I enjoyed the service and food quality I expect for any New Orleans Hamburger & Seafood Company; the icing on cake is having a Coffee & Beignet as well. New Orleans East matters and I'm glad that establishments are starting to see the potential."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Dl_okrFTBWMHm7zaIn-cqA","photo_id":"nWML53CjfOJmOIH3m-Q0yg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nWML53CjfOJmOIH3m-Q0yg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9168459177017212},{"business_id":"Dl_okrFTBWMHm7zaIn-cqA","photo_id":"xjrRZAL2na1pLknsiW1NqQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xjrRZAL2na1pLknsiW1NqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8569045662879944},{"business_id":"Dl_okrFTBWMHm7zaIn-cqA","photo_id":"a7eHAIdRVJl71e8gaj8ekw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/a7eHAIdRVJl71e8gaj8ekw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8466736674308777}]},"notebook_case":null}
